# Local development bindings. Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored).
#
# ADR-0004: one environment setting selects the authentication mode.
# `development` admits requests without an Access assertion and skips the
# credential-dependent expiry checks, so local development needs no Access
# configuration. `production` (the deployed value in wrangler.jsonc) verifies
# `Cf-Access-Jwt-Assertion` and enforces `x-mi-auth-exp`.
ENVIRONMENT=development
